      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stockport",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Roman mosaics were reportedly found at Castle Hill near Stockport market in the late 18th century, though modern dating has yet to confirm them.",
